<section class="section-shell py-24 sm:py-32 cv-auto" id="insights">
  <div class="mb-12 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.7fr] lg:items-end">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">07 — Insights</p>
      <h2 class="display mt-3 text-4xl font-bold sm:text-6xl">Notes from building real systems.</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/60">Engineering notes, architecture decisions, and practical guides for teams considering custom software.</p>
      <a class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-accent transition hover:gap-3" href="/insights">View all articles <i class="ti ti-arrow-up-right"></i></a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-12">
    <article class="group overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border-2 border-ink bg-ink text-white lg:col-span-7">
      <a class="block h-full p-7 sm:p-9" href="/insights/laravel-maintainable-architecture">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-white/50">
          <span>Engineering note</span><span>8 min read</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-16 sm:mt-24">
          <span class="inline-grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/20 text-2xl text-accent transition group-hover:rotate-45 group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-white"><i class="ti ti-arrow-up-right"></i></span>
          <h3 class="display mt-7 max-w-2xl text-3xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-5xl">Structuring Laravel applications for long-term maintenance.</h3>
          <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl leading-relaxed text-white/60">A practical approach to boundaries, services, validation, data access, and keeping business logic understandable as a product grows.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
    </article>
    <div class="grid gap-5 lg:col-span-5">
      <article class="group rounded-[2rem] border-2 border-ink bg-accent p-7 text-white sm:p-8">
        <a class="block" href="/insights/custom-erp-vs-off-the-shelf">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-white/70"><span>Business guide</span><span>6 min read</span></div>
          <h3 class="display mt-12 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight">Custom ERP or off-the-shelf software?</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-white/75">A decision framework based on workflow fit, integration needs, ownership, cost, and operational complexity.</p>
          <span class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold transition group-hover:gap-3">Read article <i class="ti ti-arrow-right"></i></span>
        </a>
      </article>
      <article class="group rounded-[2rem] border-2 border-ink bg-white p-7 sm:p-8">
        <a class="block" href="/insights/reliable-rest-api-design">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-ink/45"><span>API design</span><span>7 min read</span></div>
          <h3 class="display mt-12 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight">Designing REST APIs that remain predictable.</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-ink/60">Consistency in resources, errors, validation, pagination, permissions, and versioning.</p>
          <span class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-accent transition group-hover:gap-3">Read article <i class="ti ti-arrow-right"></i></span>
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="border-y-2 border-ink bg-white py-20 sm:py-24 cv-auto" id="clients">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:items-end">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">08 — Selected clients</p>
        <h2 class="display mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-6xl">Built across different industries.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/60">From retail operations and logistics to education, research, printing, and technology teams. Each engagement starts with understanding the real workflow—not forcing the same template onto every business.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="group rounded-[1.75rem] border-2 border-ink bg-[#f4d9d0] p-7 transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-[8px_8px_0_#151310]">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between"><span class="display text-3xl font-bold">Pelangi UV</span><i class="ti ti-printer text-3xl text-accent"></i></div><p class="mt-8 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-ink/45">Printing &amp; manufacturing</p>
      </article>
      <article class="group rounded-[1.75rem] border-2 border-ink bg-[#dce7f4] p-7 transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-[8px_8px_0_#151310]">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between"><span class="display text-3xl font-bold">Awniraya</span><i class="ti ti-truck-delivery text-3xl text-accent"></i></div><p class="mt-8 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-ink/45">Logistics &amp; freight</p>
      </article>
      <article class="group rounded-[1.75rem] border-2 border-ink bg-[#f5e0a9] p-7 transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-[8px_8px_0_#151310]">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between"><span class="display text-3xl font-bold">DAKI Pet Shop</span><i class="ti ti-paw text-3xl text-accent"></i></div><p class="mt-8 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-ink/45">Multi-branch retail</p>
      </article>
      <article class="group rounded-[1.75rem] border-2 border-ink bg-[#dcebdc] p-7 transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-[8px_8px_0_#151310]">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between"><span class="display text-3xl font-bold">Universitas Airlangga</span><i class="ti ti-school text-3xl text-accent"></i></div><p class="mt-8 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-ink/45">Education &amp; research</p>
      </article>
      <article class="group rounded-[1.75rem] border-2 border-ink bg-[#eadcf1] p-7 transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-[8px_8px_0_#151310]">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between"><span class="display text-3xl font-bold">GAPALA</span><i class="ti ti-building-bank text-3xl text-accent"></i></div><p class="mt-8 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-ink/45">Financial operations</p>
      </article>
      <article class="group rounded-[1.75rem] border-2 border-ink bg-ink p-7 text-white transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-[8px_8px_0_#ed4d2b]">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between"><span class="display text-3xl font-bold">Burningroom</span><i class="ti ti-code text-3xl text-accent"></i></div><p class="mt-8 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-white/45">Technology partner</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-3xl border border-ink/15 bg-paper p-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/60">Also worked with healthcare, contractors, local businesses, and institutional teams across Indonesia.</p>
      <a class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 font-bold text-accent" href="#contact">Discuss your project <i class="ti ti-arrow-up-right"></i></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
